{
  "dom_id": "step-e1353",
  "name": "Example: Simplifying an Expression Given That Some Variables Are Non-Negative",
  "problem": "Simplify $\\sqrt{\\dfrac{r^2}{s^2}}$ given that $s>0.$",
  "worked_solution": "The square root of a squared quantity can be simplified using absolute value:\n\n$$\n\\sqrt{x^2} = |x|\n$$\n\nIn our case, we can simplify the given expression as follows:\n\n$$\n\\eqalign{\n\\sqrt{\\dfrac{r^2}{s^2}} &= \\[5pt]\n\n\\sqrt{\\dfrac{r}{s} \\cdot \\dfrac{r}{s}} &= \\[5pt]\n\n\\sqrt{\\left(\\dfrac{r}{s}\\right)^2} &= \\[5pt]\n\n\\left|\\dfrac{r}{s}\\right| &= \\[5pt]\n\n\\dfrac{|r|}{|s|} & \n\t}\n$$\n\n \n\nWe are told that $s \\gt 0,$ and we know that the absolute value of any positive number is just itself, so we have $|s| = s.$ Therefore, our final answer is\n\n$$\n\\dfrac{|r|}{|s|} = \\dfrac{|r|}{s} .\n$$",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
  "fields": [],
  "problem_field_keys": [],
  "answer_fields_complete": null,
  "result": null,
  "proof_feedback": null,
  "html": "<div id=\"step-e1353\" class=\"step\" style=\"display: block;\">\n    \n                 \n                <div class=\"example\">\n                    <div class=\"stepHeader\">\n                        <div class=\"stepName\"><span class=\"stepType\">Example:</span> Simplifying an Expression Given That Some Variables Are Non-Negative</div>       \n                        <div class=\"helpButton\" stepid=\"e1353\">?</div>\n                    </div>\n            \n                    <div class=\"exampleQuestion\">\n                        <style type=\"text/css\">\n                            .mjpage .MJX-monospace {\n                            font-family: monospace\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage .MJX-sans-serif {\n                            font-family: sans-serif\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage {\n                            display: inline;\n                            font-style: normal;\n                            font-weight: normal;\n                            line-height: normal;\n                            font-size: 100%;\n                            font-size-adjust: none;\n                            text-indent: 0;\n                            text-align: left;\n                            text-transform: none;\n                            letter-spacing: normal;\n                            word-spacing: normal;\n                            word-wrap: normal;\n                            white-space: nowrap;\n                            float: none;\n                            direction: ltr;\n                            max-width: none;\n                            max-height: none;\n                            min-width: 0;\n                            min-height: 0;\n                            border: 0;\n                            padding: 0;\n                            margin: 0\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage *